              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wababela abantu bonke, isixuku sonke sakwa-Israyeli, kwabesifazane namadoda, kwaba yilowo nalowo iqebelengwane lesinkwa, neqatha lenyama, negabha lewayini. Basuka bonke abantu baya ezindlini zabo.",
          "type": "text",
