              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasebuyela ukubusisa indlu yakhe. UMikhali indodakazi kaSawule waphuma ukumhlangabeza uDavide, wathi: “Yeka ukukhazinyuliswa kwenkosi yakwa-Israyeli namuhla, ezivezile namuhla phambi kwezincekukazi zezinceku zayo, njengokuba umuntu oyisiwula eziveza ngokungenamahloni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
