          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wayesethi kuMikhali: “Kuphambi kukaJehova owangikhetha phambi kukayihlo naphambi kwendlu yakhe yonke ukuba angimise ngibe ngumbusi phezu kwabantu bakaJehova kwa-Israyeli; ngalokho ngiyakudlala phambi kukaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
