              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngiyoba yisinengiso kakhulu kunalokho, futhi ngiyoba mncane emehlweni ami; nezincekukazi okhulume ngazo ngiyakudunyiswa ngazo.",
          "type": "text",
